			"Message": "refactor(Project): Enforce PascalCase naming across native backend and UI layers\n\nSystematically rename functions, variables, parameters, and command identifiers from snake_case to PascalCase to satisfy the project-wide naming convention defined in CLAUDE.md.\n\n**Mountain:** Refactor IPC utilities, Tauri command handlers (Dns, Tls, Process, Health), and gRPC field mappings to use PascalCase. Update `effect!` macro parameter extraction and ensure error bindings follow the `Error`/`E` convention. Align generated protobuf fields with the new casing rules.\n\n**Output:** Update TypeScript polyfills and proxy layers to match renamed Tauri commands (e.g., `ProcessGetExecPath`, `CocoonExtensionHostHealth`), ensuring the frontend correctly invokes the native backend.\n\n**Wind:** Align the Vine notification stream implementation with PascalCase identifiers (`VineSubscribeNotifications`, `VineSubscriberCount`) for all Tauri interactions.\n\n**Impact:** Eliminates style inconsistencies across the Rust/TypeScript boundary, ensuring strict adherence to the effect-based architectural principles and naming standards.",
			"SHA": "dcce41748026c6aa930bc28bb415a235176bcc97"
		},
